                ],
                [
                    124.0,
                    669.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">All three models showed positive mean gaps that exceeded their permutation null (Table 7, Fig. 3). Geneformer V1: +0.72% (p = 0.030), scGPT-human: +0.36% (p = 0.014), and UCE-4L: +6.40% (p < 0.002). The negative control on AIDA v2, using random pseudo-contamination scores, returned mean gaps of -0.00%, -0.00%, and +0.17%, confirming the test is correctly calibrated.</div>\n",
            "block_bbox": [
