;'>[-1.96, +1.42]</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>&lt; 0.002</td></tr><tr><td colspan=\"7\">AIDA v2 (random pseudo-contamination, negative control):</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>Geneformer V1</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>-0.00%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>66/147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>scGPT-human</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>-0.00%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>70/147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td></tr><tr><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>UCE-4L</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>+0.17%</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>73/147</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td><td style='text-align: center; word-wrap: break-word;'>—</td></tr></table>",
