        {
            "block_label": "figure_title",
            "block_content": "<div style=\"text-align: center;\">Table 7: Donor-matched within-cell-type contamination effect on embedding tightness.  $ \\bar{\\Delta} $ is the mean of per-pair relative tightness gaps (Eq. 8). Permutation null: contamination labels shuffled within each (cell-type, donor) group, B = 500 trials. Negative control on AIDA: random uniform pseudo-contamination scores assigned to each cell.</div>\n",
