                    124.0,
                    1403.0
                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "The cross-architecture replication, all three models reach permutation-significance with the same sign, and the perfectly null negative control together support the interpretation that the gap reflects pretraining exposure rather than artifacts of clustering, normalization, or donor batch.",
